{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891720/extras/9b177dcf6270fa4dc94e7f4df916fcec.poster.avif?t=1771117898\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891720/extras/9b177dcf6270fa4dc94e7f4df916fcec.webm?t=1771117898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891720/extras/9b177dcf6270fa4dc94e7f4df916fcec.mp4?t=1771117898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Necromage lets you command multiple minion factions to fight and explore a dark world of dungeons.<br>Harvest corpses to fuel your army, strengthen minions through progression, and expand your forces through necromantic mastery.<br>Descend into corruption, confront powerful enemies, and reclaim a world shaped by death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891720/extras/fff2819a6cab20e87c4a1d4c9c4e7fef.poster.avif?t=1771117898\" width=940 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891720/extras/fff2819a6cab20e87c4a1d4c9c4e7fef.webm?t=1771117898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891720/extras/fff2819a6cab20e87c4a1d4c9c4e7fef.mp4?t=1771117898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consume corpses to fill Ectoplasm, then Health, then Mana.<br>Use Ectoplasm to summon minions. Increase Ectoplasm capacity through leveling and items to summon more minions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891720/extras/b5d41abe3029b2011b5533395aedfc8b.poster.avif?t=1771117898\" width=940 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891720/extras/b5d41abe3029b2011b5533395aedfc8b.webm?t=1771117898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891720/extras/b5d41abe3029b2011b5533395aedfc8b.mp4?t=1771117898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight using powerful minion skills, both passive and active.<br>There are three minion tiers, each with unique abilities:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Common</strong> \u2013 You can summon as many as your Ectoplasm allows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elite</strong> \u2013 Only one can be active; has a powerful active skill.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leader</strong> \u2013 Only one can be active; has a powerful active skill.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891720/extras/99bf900b4e48ebdbc86d461762596399.poster.avif?t=1771117898\" width=940 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891720/extras/99bf900b4e48ebdbc86d461762596399.webm?t=1771117898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891720/extras/99bf900b4e48ebdbc86d461762596399.mp4?t=1771117898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip your minions using crafted spells. Upgrade their Rank to unlock powerful passive and active skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891720/extras/2ebefbafd8e435b8acc4b1d169a02251.poster.avif?t=1771117898\" width=940 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891720/extras/2ebefbafd8e435b8acc4b1d169a02251.webm?t=1771117898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891720/extras/2ebefbafd8e435b8acc4b1d169a02251.mp4?t=1771117898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each faction has skills that work together. Choose one faction or mix them freely.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skeletons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood Seekers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humans</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891720/extras/65338926fe799d0b4b2328902254f1c7.poster.avif?t=1771117898\" width=940 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891720/extras/65338926fe799d0b4b2328902254f1c7.webm?t=1771117898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891720/extras/65338926fe799d0b4b2328902254f1c7.mp4?t=1771117898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft powerful spells to empower your minions. Crafting items are stored separately from hero gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891720/extras/94238a28af27857d33e84155711365b6.poster.avif?t=1771117898\" width=940 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891720/extras/94238a28af27857d33e84155711365b6.webm?t=1771117898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891720/extras/94238a28af27857d33e84155711365b6.mp4?t=1771117898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find powerful loot to empower your hero and minions. Hero gear is separate from crafting items and can be recycled into materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891720/extras/91c147811d1e4235546694e5df4cc342.poster.avif?t=1771117898\" width=940 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891720/extras/91c147811d1e4235546694e5df4cc342.webm?t=1771117898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891720/extras/91c147811d1e4235546694e5df4cc342.mp4?t=1771117898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your hero and choose your path through five skill tiers<strong>:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Basic</strong> \u2013 Core actions and early power</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Passive</strong> \u2013 Always-on bonuses and synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core</strong> \u2013 Defining skills that shape your playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced</strong> \u2013 Strong upgrades and specialized effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultimate</strong> \u2013 Powerful abilities with major impact</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2891720?t=1771117898","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse